SPDX identifiers are declared at the top of each file. Files that mix prose and
code (for example `docs/14-plantillas.md`) use `CC-BY-SA-4.0 AND MIT`: the
prose is CC BY-SA 4.0 and the original code blocks are MIT.

Third-party code, quotations and data remain under their original licenses.
Read [`NOTICE`](NOTICE) before reusing any snippet that cites one of the four
source projects.

This is a licensing statement, not legal advice.
